engine: one AudioWorklet (the component's kernel text, twice): in (a tap) → a fast follower (0.5 / 25 ms) and a slow one (40 / 300 ms); a hit
  = the fast one over the slow one by Sensitivity dB, above Hears from, at least Gap after the last; re-armed once the fast falls back.
  Each hit: the Pulse out (1, falling over Length) and a message with its exact time → a note (Note, Length, velocity from the hit when
  Velocity is on) on every tool wired to Notes out, booked at the hit's time.
ports: in (audio, tap, primary) · out: Notes (note:trigger) · Pulse (mod)
packs: factory — Kick Plays Bass · Snare Stabs · Every Transient · Only The Big Ones · Ghost Notes · Slow Pulse
acceptance (hits.test.js, P245): 8 kicks in → 8 hits, each within 3 ms of its kick, the Pulse 1 at each; a steady tone → no hits after its
  start; Gap stops double hits; Notes wired into Ripple play it on each hit; a sound wired in is still heard where it was

